ofindia.indiatimes.com/india/anti-people-karnataka-bjp-stages-protest-against-congress-over-price-hikes-including-milk/articleshow/135731768.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135731768.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In Karnataka, the Bharatiya Janata Party organized protests against soaring prices, particularly targeting the costs of milk and transportation. Former Chief Minister Basavaraj Bommai underscored how increased taxes weigh heavily on everyday people. BS Yediyurappa echoed these concerns, criticizing the Congress government for its perceived disregard for citizens as essential item costs continue to soar. Protest leaders urged the government to retract these hikes to ease public suffering.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/anti-people-karnataka-bjp-stages-protest-against-congress-over-price-hikes-including-milk/articleshow/135731768.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/anti-people-karnataka-bjp-stages-protest-against-congress-over-price-hikes-including-milk/articleshow/135731768.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T14:50:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135732157,imgsize-199508.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Terrorists open fire at CRPF party in J&amp;K's Kulgam, 3 injured]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/terrorists-attack-crpf-personnel-in-jks-kulgam-search-operation-launched/articleshow/135732041.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135732041.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/terrorists-attack-crpf-personnel-in-jks-kulgam-search-operation-launched/articleshow/135732041.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/terrorists-attack-crpf-personnel-in-jks-kulgam-search-operation-launched/articleshow/135732041.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T14:47:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135732074,imgsize-1270978.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Let us have a debate': Akhilesh Yadav challenges BJP over demonetisation]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-us-have-a-debate-akhilesh-yadav-challenges-bjp-over-demonetisation/articleshow/135731397.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135731397.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav has renewed his criticism of the 2016 demonetisation, describing it as a major corruption scandal. He alleges that the currency ban has adversely affected banks and small traders, particularly MSMEs. Yadav challenges the government's banking reforms and blames demonetisation for increasing cash circulation. Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath responds by accusing opposition parties of past corruption and recruitment irregularities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-us-have-a-debate-akhilesh-yadav-challenges-bjp-over-demonetisation/articleshow/135731397.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/let-us-have-a-debate-akhilesh-yadav-challenges-bjp-over-demonetisation/articleshow/135731397.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T14:46:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135731932,imgsize-118332.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['She's like a statesman': Robert Vadra urges BJP leaders to read Sonia Gandhi's memoir]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shes-like-a-statesman-robert-vadra-urges-bjp-leaders-to-read-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135730758.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135730758.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Robert Vadra urged BJP leaders to delve into Sonia Gandhi's memoir, 'Belonging: A Journey of Love', and to do so with empathy. With pride, he spoke of his mother-in-law's inspiring journey, outlining her remarkable strength since relocating to India. Vadra also emphasized Gandhi's unwavering support during his interactions with the Enforcement Directorate, while defending her intentional decision to prioritize the nation over a prime ministerial role.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shes-like-a-statesman-robert-vadra-urges-bjp-leaders-to-read-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135730758.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/shes-like-a-statesman-robert-vadra-urges-bjp-leaders-to-read-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135730758.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T14:39:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135730758,imgsize-118640.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Babar premis will be punished': BJP targets TMC's Kirti Azad over Ram Mandir remarks]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/babar-premis-will-be-punished-bjp-targets-tmcs-kirti-azad-over-ram-mandir-remarks/articleshow/135729487.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135729487.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP spokesperson Pradeep Bhandari criticized TMC MP Kirti Azad for his recent comments regarding Lord Ram and Ayodhya. Bhandari accused opposition parties of engaging in vote bank politics while expressing disdain towards Hindu sentiments. Azad claimed he would not visit the Ram Mandir and questioned Lord Ram's treatment of Maa Sita. The controversy arises ahead of Akhilesh Yadav's proposed visit to the temple in December.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/babar-premis-will-be-punished-bjp-targets-tmcs-kirti-azad-over-ram-mandir-remarks/articleshow/135729487.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/babar-premis-will-be-punished-bjp-targets-tmcs-kirti-azad-over-ram-mandir-remarks/articleshow/135729487.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T13:09:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135729611,imgsize-113176.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Gave up PM post, became Super PM': BJP targets Sonia Gandhi over UPA role after memoir release]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gave-up-pm-post-became-super-pm-bjp-targets-sonia-gandhi-over-upa-role-after-memoir-release/articleshow/135729495.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135729495.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gave-up-pm-post-became-super-pm-bjp-targets-sonia-gandhi-over-upa-role-after-memoir-release/articleshow/135729495.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/gave-up-pm-post-became-super-pm-bjp-targets-sonia-gandhi-over-upa-role-after-memoir-release/articleshow/135729495.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-11T13:06:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.co